#
# This is a MONOREPO. Environment variables are configured per-package:
#
#   Frontend (Vercel):   frontend/.env.example  → copy to frontend/.env.local
#   Backend  (Render):   backend/.env.example   → copy to backend/.env.local
#   Database (Supabase): database/.env.example  → reference only
#
# See docs/ENVIRONMENT_SETUP.md for full setup instructions.
# NEVER commit real secrets to git.
# ============================================================================
